's Dogma 2 performance fixed for those who want to jump back in","user":"selene3585","edited":true},{"id":"1545110570305331281","ts":1788453466,"author":"TheTenoray","author_id":"403063093095170049","text":"Snagged a copy of Orbitals. Now I need a friend to play with.","user":"technotenore","attachments":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/DickersDiscord/media/20260903_123457-8cc0638e4c59b2d7.jpg","kind":"image","name":"20260903_123457.jpg"}]},{"id":"1545147288244977664","ts":1788462220,"author":"Queef Huffer","author_id":"242695431103053834","text":"https://news.xbox.com/en-us/2026/09/03/xbox-cloud-gaming-changes/","user":"kzs0009"},{"id":"1545178931391365180","ts":1788469765,"author":"Abbhi1993","author_id":"759248189433446440","text":"One downside of the Switch 2 logo on the game cases. Is that the game art is like 1/3rd covered on top. Only wish Nintendo could’ve kept the Switch logo design like on the corner. So we can see more of the game art.","user":"abbhi1993","reply_to":"1545110570305331281","edited":true},{"id":"1545301897974648843","ts":1788499082,"author":"🇺🇸 ManBear","author_id":"1274888411349782551","text":"","user":"manbear40k","attachments":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/DickersDiscord/media/786915942_1790095648813066_680353928432311-8521385e0d4908fc.jpg","kind":"image","name":"786915942_1790095648813066_6803539284323118728_n.jpg"}],"reactions":[{"e":"😂","n":1}]},{"id":"1545483147498758235","ts":1788542296,"author":"Loafin OG","author_id":"1141060176745611495","text":"I wish they did it would be so funny","user":"biggusloafus","reply_to":"1545301897974648843","reactions":[{"e":"😂","n":1}]},{"id":"1545529245789462649","ts":1788553286,"author":"Benny Swiftfoot","author_id":"129059951535587328","text":"https://youtu.be/NXLz3JCRovU?is=Regt9lpqEaoxTJOq","user":"swiftfoot1989"},{"id":"1545541377545207889","ts":1788556179,"author":"LostInGaming","author_id":"153382447189327872","text":"I guess im stupid then because when it comes to PC im buying t